{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3dbcc01d27a7595931ef4e502a5001acfd59a66f9f972c02f0033bfc42a88a7e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0803907462bf9f118759c16f335b3f366380fc4fa550d0a5efef60c1572ba6e4","slc_4c1da880d35226a8f5366d83eabef3577f02a61401c70db237725fbb9bcb7a44","slc_cddc83159426a795ec0686d51e772670ffb72e3bb3f08fb43086ac1ee59f6445"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"Each agent runs in its own Docker or Podman container, with default images published under the `vibepod` namespace on Docker Hub (e.g. `vibepod/claude:latest`, `vibepod/codex:latest`).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4159193229c12321477102e459493848f58508a800d2f989df15964f27e1c450","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_278133dce51755b40d095ecf4a112e9b0f03c01b4340fa22b5631d14b6db2f63","slc_49dabbb7823ef38324127a4a789655188a0bcb75075e63ef5308b50531589337","slc_a87b50be6e8cab6c2e24843be433de1e137f1652fd5d806767ee127f603e49b5"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"Metrics are collected locally while agents run and served through a built-in dashboard managed via `vp logs start/stop/status`, showing per-agent HTTP traffic, usage over time, and Claude token metrics.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_50c0ee0bbe48c244d12500bef316e64c8af9e08294af86c2221cad6b6bad446c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e4f643df6be36c25def37e399d78fc6f09ad187ea2000147c64fed5bd3c0408"],"source_ids":["src_5042c1b39a10567681570fd1c89eb99e"],"text":"Repository development practice: the test runner is pytest (`python -m pytest`); CI also validates default images with `scripts/check_default_images.py`, and `ruff check`, `ruff format --check`, and `mypy` are pre-commit gated. Tests should run with a throwaway `VP_CONFIG_DIR` when a host global config exists.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5835348860345d9d0d91ce0e68f0d4f6378517660cfe16d6ca8f8bbde6244210","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_39e894d6b9fd3f54394d0f93371ba7ec5ca15ba0462e11bf98c58e6cf94f9fca"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"The project describes itself as privacy-first: all metrics are collected and stored locally and never sent to the cloud.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_65cc574b85b2d8a5f9efa36f1c855bda2b1ab476aa5abfcf379e73838cbb5b5a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_993e72c6d71633cd07eb5b668c5c3b7723745b87e3a4c8ff06d499cf9ed51e0c","slc_dd86f7fb58c5dfbdc52c2b36ece2256e537ae9f73fe67b0014717d726716de4c"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"`--ikwid` appends each agent's auto-approval/permission-skip flag when supported; e.g. claude gets `--dangerously-skip-permissions`, gemini and qwen get `--approval-mode=yolo`, and several agents (opencode, auggie, tau, jcode, freebuff, dsh) are listed as not supported.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_718605621670a3b371a48d654c4c4b2de63b573a603ad07da77607bb1ae4162f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_338675ef04b082a83fe911dfbd2e814b51da1595ae4ae9599b8a328eca99d52b","slc_3ccbf8554253aa5b9c1677ce13618f18ae6517732a7656232a03ae5efe3e2329","slc_729768be81793ef407e4ad66f7033fd1ea2870d950384d5262e49b899679b442","slc_95cd1e51f90c94d9770425b992003b33cfcbedbdef524f2b47449edbe8772cee","slc_a291d79730d777f990aa028f6005d7446a4beec1e56fd67c5a660cb130982d55","slc_e56074c44836a392cb57fd496e93308d894c9ab859d6510947908c83710b5913"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"The CLI is installable via pip (`pip install vibepod`), Homebrew, and conda-forge (conda, mamba, pixi).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8ebe4a6ab137885c1e9b9ff564cfee3a0418039e0220a972aac6dfa2e0d88600","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_39e894d6b9fd3f54394d0f93371ba7ec5ca15ba0462e11bf98c58e6cf94f9fca"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"Project overlays let users commit a FROM-less Dockerfile fragment in `.vibepod/overlay/`; VibePod auto-builds a cached, content-addressed image layer on top of the agent's base image.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5c4ffb79a0645efc9a4f803666364306864eaba630392c31d9710da2edf9363","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_eac284713189fe6b92f7134e1513da126c116fd8ac124ce6b019d3fd36fb6de4"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"`vp run <agent> --acp` turns the CLI into an Agent Client Protocol adapter so the containerized agent appears in ACP-capable editors like Zed, with isolation, profiles, overlays and proxy metrics intact.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6ec1f0db41fcf1a048564c6adca0287e2245852b103ad24e02b9f1a8f76037a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_39e894d6b9fd3f54394d0f93371ba7ec5ca15ba0462e11bf98c58e6cf94f9fca"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"Reusable prompt recipes ('skills') can be installed per-project or per-user with `vp skills add`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e571f591456707e025b6162ad43133b5cb9107c0f1256c63a64c83faadb4b670","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_47c28e40c1c1527693fbc68f1bc4f3e3f587689d7c7550001ded0f40690826ec"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"Implemented v1 commands include `vp run`, `vp stop <agent|--all>`, `vp list`, `vp config init/show/path`, and `vp version`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e91eaa48f1a08e42e542895ab9a6557da30db892c06592384ef78b9d81740138","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0803907462bf9f118759c16f335b3f366380fc4fa550d0a5efef60c1572ba6e4","slc_2ab0c8e147623972a3f722ea22b79f60f275567cce4773e75cecfd76796a4c76","slc_5c5a1387554d940dbd8593d798116161ad1009ae170fb74b452ec060557f53ba"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"The product is a unified CLI named `vp`; `vp run <agent>` launches an agent with no required configuration, and extra arguments after `--` are forwarded to the agent process.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","created_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f7492468b539c503e317b0cef46179c58eb1bd30e2fa892b8f531ba7e47bded3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"vibepod/vibepod-cli@ef6519007b1d snapshot c5c8a1991d43f49f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bd8847b3136cbda2791b81f6d0a4be2a42fd688405747f019a2ff154b9ea3350","slc_bee0f8e9418e24af83326b6169003a4eafd40327dbb0668acf83deca4b91ede7"],"source_ids":["src_0da32aa802d754e78c8c9e564f0d43e5"],"text":"Individual images can be overridden per agent via environment variables such as `VP_IMAGE_CLAUDE`, plus `VP_DATASETTE_IMAGE` for the dashboard and `VP_SKILLS_ENGINE_IMAGE` for skills commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:21:45Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4c9aa1a94916442b9ede63ee46a01d22"}
